WEBVTT

00:00:58.262 --> 00:01:01.509
and he says he suspects
it's part of a drug crime.

00:01:02.252 --> 00:01:03.406
A few days later,

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:07.364
the local district attorney files
paperwork to keep your money --

00:01:07.388 --> 00:01:08.621
permanently.

00:01:09.219 --> 00:01:10.370
And all of this happens

00:01:10.394 --> 00:01:14.459
without you ever being charged
or convicted of any crime.

00:01:15.197 --> 00:01:16.519
Now, you might be saying,

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:19.594
"Ah, this would never happen
in the United States."

00:01:20.293 --> 00:01:23.578
(Laughter)

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:27.919
Incidents like this occur
every day in our country.

00:01:27.943 --> 00:01:31.010
It's one of the most significant threats
to your property rights